      "difficulty": "Intermediate",
      "bloom": "Apply",
      "question": "Ex 13.1 Q1: Find the mean number of plants per house given: (0-2:1), (2-4:2), (4-6:1), (6-8:5), (8-10:6), (10-12:2), (12-14:3).",
      "question_hi": "अभ्यास 13.1 प्र1: प्रति घर पौधों की माध्य संख्या ज्ञात करें: (0-2:1), (2-4:2), (4-6:1), (6-8:5), (8-10:6), (10-12:2), (12-14:3)।",
      "question_gu": "ક. 13.1 Q1: ઘર દીઠ છોડની મધ્યક સંખ્યા શોધો: (0-2:1), (2-4:2), (4-6:1), (6-8:5), (8-10:6), (10-12:2), (12-14:3).",
      "options": ["8.1", "7.9", "8.5", "9.1"],
      "options_hi": ["8.1", "7.9", "8.5", "9.1"],
      "options_gu": ["8.1", "7.9", "8.5", "9.1"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "Mid points (x): 1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13. Σfx = 1(1) + 2(3) + 1(5) + 5(7) + 6(9) + 2(11) + 3(13) = 1 + 6 + 5 + 35 + 54 + 22 + 39 = 162. Σf = 20. Mean = 162/20 = 8.1.",
      "explanation_hi": "Σfx = 162, Σf = 20। माध्य = 162/20 = 8.1।",
      "explanation_gu": "Σfx = 162, Σf = 20. મધ્યક = 162/20 = 8.1."
    },
