      "options_hi": ["20", "15", "18", "22"],
      "options_gu": ["20", "15", "18", "22"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "Σfx = 752 + 20f. Σf = 44 + f. Mean = (752 + 20f)/(44 + f) = 18. 752 + 20f = 792 + 18f. 2f = 40 => f = 20.",
      "explanation_hi": "752 + 20f = 18(44 + f) => 20f - 18f = 792 - 752 => 2f = 40 => f = 20।",
      "explanation_gu": "752 + 20f = 18(44 + f) => 20f - 18f = 792 - 752 => 2f = 40 => f = 20."
